# Isla Ceniza, north half (C7, contract 53), 36 x 15. column = i, row = j. A VOLCANIC town on a bay: the two inlets of the NORTH edge ((7..8,0) -> Ruta 21 `south`, (26..27,0) -> Ruta 20 `south`; the hero arrives
# surfing on the bay, spawns `bay_w` / `bay_e`) and the ash shore; pale volcanic ASH ground, lava rocks (the border of the other sides), animated steam vents, palms and the volcano (2 x 2, back right). The Planeador lands in front of the Centro
# (@fly slot 9, (13,10)). Buildings (door = the middle cell of the bottom row): the fossil lab (5,9), the Centro (13,9), the tienda (21,9). The gap (16..19,14) leads to the south half. Two townsfolk, two signs. Wild water table + the three rods (the bay).
@map isla_ceniza
@size 36 15
@interior no
@area isla_ceniza
@fly 9 isla_ceniza 13 10 face=S   # the Planeador lands here, in front of the Centro door; slot 9 = visited flag 993 (contract 46.1 / 53)
@bg 0
@surf yes
@fill ash
@encounters water rate=12
  urchip 32 36 5
  urchlord 34 38 55
  gleamlet 32 35 15
  lazatee 34 37 10
  clubrimp 32 36 15
@end
@encounters fish_old
  flopfin 5 5 100
@end
@encounters fish_good rate=128
  glidefin 22 26 40
  inkit 22 26 40
  flopfin 15 15 20
@end
@encounters fish_super
  inkit 30 36 30
  glidefin 30 36 30
  urchlord 34 38 20
  barnacub 30 34 20
@end
@spawn bay_w 7 1 S
@spawn bay_e 26 1 S
@spawn centro_door 13 10 S
@spawn tienda_door 21 10 S
@spawn lab_door 5 10 S
@spawn south 17 13 N
@legend
  .  tile=ash
  a  tile=sea_o
  b  tile=ash object=lava_rock
  c  tile=sea_bl
  d  tile=ash object=palm_0
  e  tile=ash object=lab
  f  tile=ash object=center_f
  g  tile=ash object=volcano
  h  tile=ash
  i  tile=ash object=mart_f
  j  tile=sea_gate
  k  tile=sea_gate
  l  tile=sea_gate
  m  tile=ash object=steam_vent
  n  tile=ash object=sign interact=look text=ceniza.sign
  o  tile=ash door=lab
  p  tile=ash door=center_f
  q  tile=ash door=mart_f
  r  tile=ash object=sign interact=look text=ceniza.sign.lab
  s  tile=ash face=SE id=npc_b npc=chica_s text=ceniza.npc.b
  t  tile=ash face=SW id=npc_a npc=cientifico_s script=hint_isla
  H  tile=ash hidden=growth_seed   # hidden (contract 80, hidden items)
@grid
  aaaaaaajjaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaakkaaaaaaaa
  aaaaaaalaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaalaaaaaaaaa
  aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa
  aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa
  cccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccc
  b..d.......d.....d......d........d.b
  b........m....b....................b
  b.........n..............m.....gg.Hb
  b...eee.....fff.....ii.........gg..b
  b...eoe.....fpf.....iq.............b
  b......r.........................b.b
  b..............s...................b
  b.b.....tb......b.......b...b......b
  b.........d...........d............b
  bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbhhhhbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb
@warp j -> ruta_21 spawn=south
@warp k -> ruta_20 spawn=south
@warp h -> isla_ceniza_sur spawn=north
@warp o -> laboratorio_fosiles spawn=door
@warp p -> centro_ceniza spawn=door
@warp q -> tienda_ceniza spawn=door
# D1 (contract 68): a clue of the hidden Gruta del Eclipse (where it is).
@script hint_isla npc
    npc_face_hero npc_a
    say ceniza.npc.a
    say d1.hint.isla
@end
